WEBVTT

00:02.585 --> 00:05.004
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:05.088 --> 00:06.715
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:06.798 --> 00:08.383
Kids:
aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：
是的，是的，船长。

00:08.466 --> 00:11.511
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:11.594 --> 00:13.555
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.638 --> 00:15.849
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:15.932 --> 00:17.642
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.726 --> 00:19.978
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:20.061 --> 00:21.771
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.855 --> 00:24.023
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:24.107 --> 00:25.859
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:25.942 --> 00:27.485
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:27.569 --> 00:29.195
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:29.279 --> 00:30.697
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:30.780 --> 00:32.365
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:32.449 --> 00:34.367
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:34.451 --> 00:37.078
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

00:53.970 --> 00:57.056
SpongeBob: 97, 98, 99...
海绵宝宝：97、98、99……

00:58.141 --> 00:59.726
100.
100.
100.
100.
100.
100.
100.
100.

00:59.809 --> 01:02.937
Ok, Gary, let's do
the other side now.
好的，加里，我们开始吧
现在另一边。

01:03.021 --> 01:04.230
Gary?
加里？

01:04.314 --> 01:06.483
Can you hear that?
你能听到吗？

01:18.161 --> 01:19.788
Oh, Squidward, it's you.
哦，章鱼哥，是你。

01:19.871 --> 01:22.081
I thought I heard something.
我以为我听到了什么。

01:22.165 --> 01:25.502
SpongeBob, I've been sitting
here motionless for 45 minutes.
海绵宝宝，我一直坐着
在这里一动不动45分钟。

01:25.585 --> 01:28.296
What could you possibly
have heard me doing?
你可能会做什么
有听到我在做什么吗？

01:28.379 --> 01:30.757
Breathing.
呼吸。

01:30.840 --> 01:35.720
SpongeBob, I will give you $5
if you let me enjoy the rest
of my morning in peace.
海绵宝宝，我给你5美元
如果你让我享受剩下的时光
我平静的早晨。

01:35.804 --> 01:37.138
Ok.
好的。

01:39.057 --> 01:41.434
Hey, I could've sworn
I had $5 in here.
嘿，我可以发誓
我这里有 5 美元。

01:41.518 --> 01:43.520
I have it, Squidward.
我有它，章鱼哥。

01:43.603 --> 01:46.731
You gave it to me
to leave you alone yesterday.
你给了我
昨天让你一个人呆着。

01:46.815 --> 01:48.441
Squidward, you can have
the $5 back.
章鱼哥，你可以拥有
5 美元返还。

01:48.525 --> 01:50.276
Mr. Krabs says...
蟹老板说……

01:50.360 --> 01:52.237
I don't care
what Mr. Krabs says.
我不在乎
蟹老板说的话。

01:52.320 --> 01:54.989
I just want...
我只想...

01:55.073 --> 01:57.992
Coffee rain!
咖啡雨！

01:58.076 --> 02:01.329
It's hot chocolate.
这是热巧克力。

02:01.412 --> 02:04.541
Chocolate rain!
巧克力雨！

02:04.624 --> 02:08.336
Squidward.
章鱼哥。

02:09.671 --> 02:11.339
Squidward, wait!
章鱼哥，等等！

02:24.561 --> 02:25.812
It's locked.
它被锁了。

02:25.895 --> 02:27.272
SpongeBob: Squidward.
海绵宝宝：章鱼哥。

02:27.355 --> 02:29.649
Squid...ward.
鱿鱼……病房。

02:31.609 --> 02:34.445
Huh?
啊？

02:34.529 --> 02:36.406
The key.
关键。

02:36.489 --> 02:38.533
Oh, where did I put
that stupid...
哦，我放哪儿了
那个傻...

02:38.616 --> 02:39.993
Squidward.
章鱼哥。

02:41.411 --> 02:42.787
Squidward.
章鱼哥。

02:42.871 --> 02:44.998
Oh, why can't I just find the...
哦，为什么我找不到...

02:45.081 --> 02:46.124
Squidward?
章鱼哥？

02:46.207 --> 02:47.250
What?
什么？

02:49.252 --> 02:51.921
You left your keys on
the table back there.
你把钥匙开着
后面的桌子。

02:53.339 --> 02:54.382
Hey, Squidward.
嘿，章鱼哥。

02:54.465 --> 02:56.467
Yes?
是的？

02:56.551 --> 02:58.094
Didn't you used to have one
of those cucumber bicycles?
你以前不是有一个吗
那些黄瓜自行车？

02:58.177 --> 02:59.846
Oh,  .
哦，  。

02:59.929 --> 03:02.098
That was a recumbent bicycle,
and I sold it.
那是一辆卧式自行车，
我把它卖了。

03:02.181 --> 03:03.892
Why?
为什么？

03:03.975 --> 03:05.310
So I could get further
away from you!
所以我可以走得更远
离你远点！

03:11.149 --> 03:13.526
Ok, I'll see you
later then, Squidward.
好的，我会见到你
后来，章鱼哥。

03:13.610 --> 03:17.405
Bon voyage, nincompoop.
一路顺风，傻瓜。

03:22.118 --> 03:24.621
What the?
什么？

03:26.623 --> 03:28.875
Can I help you, Officer?
我可以帮你吗，警官？

03:28.958 --> 03:30.668
No.
不。

03:30.752 --> 03:33.046
But you can help yourself
to this ticket.
但你可以帮助自己
到这张票。

03:34.297 --> 03:35.715
Ticket?
票？

03:37.216 --> 03:38.635
Officer, please.
军官，请。

03:38.718 --> 03:40.887
I have impeccable boat smarts.
我拥有无可挑剔的驾船智慧。

03:40.970 --> 03:42.889
I pride myself in maintaining
an unsoiled driving record.
我为自己能够保持
未受污染的驾驶记录

03:42.972 --> 03:45.558
It's all that I have.
这就是我所拥有的一切。

03:45.642 --> 03:49.771
Well, you can have it again
right after you complete
boating school.
嗯，你可以再拥有一次
right after you complete
boating school.

03:55.360 --> 03:56.486
Boating school.
划船学校。

03:58.237 --> 04:00.073
Oh, well.
那好吧。

04:00.156 --> 04:01.574
It's just one day out
of your life, Squiddy.
这只是一天的时间
你的生活，鱿鱼。

04:01.658 --> 04:03.201
How bad could it be?
有多糟糕？

04:03.284 --> 04:06.913
Oh, Squidward.
哦，章鱼哥。

04:09.624 --> 04:11.501
Good morning, class.
早上好，同学们。

04:11.584 --> 04:13.086
Would everyone please
take a seat?
请大家
请坐吗？

04:14.420 --> 04:15.463
Psst, Squidward.
嘘，章鱼哥。

04:15.546 --> 04:16.923
Sit here.
坐在这里。

04:17.006 --> 04:18.716
Here.
这里。

04:18.800 --> 04:20.802
Um, excuse me.
嗯，对不起。

04:20.885 --> 04:22.762
There don't seem to be
any empty seats left.
好像没有
剩余的空座位。

04:22.845 --> 04:24.847
But there's one
right next to SpongeBob.
但有一个
就在海绵宝宝旁边。

04:30.019 --> 04:31.354
Do you mind?
你介意吗？

04:31.437 --> 04:32.730
Don't worry, Squidward.
别担心，章鱼哥。

04:32.814 --> 04:34.899
We're boating buddies now.
我们现在是划船的伙伴了。

04:34.983 --> 04:39.028
I'll teach you everything
I know, and then we can...
我会教你一切
我知道，然后我们可以...

04:39.112 --> 04:42.615
We won't be doing anything,
because there is no "we".
我们不会做任何事
因为没有“我们”。

04:42.699 --> 04:44.242
Understand?
理解？

04:44.325 --> 04:45.493
Quiet in the front, please.
请前面安静。

04:45.576 --> 04:47.203
Oh, I understand.
哦，我明白了。

04:47.286 --> 04:51.791
I understand perfectly...
boating buddy.
我完全理解...
划船的朋友。

04:51.874 --> 04:53.710
Mrs. Puff: Ok, class.
普芙老师：好的，同学们。

04:53.793 --> 04:55.837
Why don't we get
to know our new students
为什么我们不得到
了解我们的新学生

04:55.920 --> 04:57.964
by telling each other why
we were sentenced to...
通过告诉对方原因
我们被判...

04:58.047 --> 05:00.925
I mean, why we are enrolled
in boating school.
我的意思是，我们为什么注册
在划船学校。

05:01.009 --> 05:03.386
Um, I got caught speeding.
嗯，我超速被抓了。

05:03.469 --> 05:04.512
Very good.
非常好。

05:04.595 --> 05:06.347
Next.
下一个。

05:06.431 --> 05:07.932
I don't see what's
so very good about it.
我不明白是什么
非常好。

05:08.016 --> 05:09.267
No, I didn't mean very...
不，我的意思不是很...

05:10.727 --> 05:11.978
I know what you meant.
我知道你的意思。

05:12.061 --> 05:13.396
Next.
下一个。

05:13.479 --> 05:15.273
I am here because my...
我来这里是因为我的...

05:15.356 --> 05:17.608
We all know why
you're here, SpongeBob.
我们都知道为什么
你在这里，海绵宝宝。

05:17.692 --> 05:18.735
What about you, sir?
先生，你呢？

05:18.818 --> 05:20.069
What, me?
什么，我？

05:20.153 --> 05:22.363
Yes.
是的。

05:22.447 --> 05:23.781
Would you like to tell
the rest of the class
why you're with us today?
你想告诉吗
班里的其他人
你今天为什么和我们在一起？

05:23.865 --> 05:25.283
Why, I...
为什么，我...

05:27.910 --> 05:29.829
All right, I'll tell you.
好吧，我告诉你。

05:29.912 --> 05:32.248
I was trying
to get away from him!
我正在尝试
远离他！

05:34.709 --> 05:36.586
He is the bane of my existence.
他是我存在的祸根。

05:36.669 --> 05:38.713
Yours too?
你的也是吗？

05:38.796 --> 05:41.174
Uh, what I meant to say was,
please come up to the chalkboard
呃，我想说的是，
请到黑板前来

05:41.257 --> 05:43.760
and draw a diagram
of the incident.
并画出图表
事件的经过。

05:43.843 --> 05:46.679
Squidward: Gladly.
章鱼哥：很高兴。

05:46.763 --> 05:48.097
It all started
when I left my house.
一切都开始了
当我离开家时。

05:52.435 --> 05:54.687
And then he appeared.
然后他出现了。

05:56.773 --> 05:59.609
He made an immediate
right turn and parked...
他立即做出了
右转并停车...

05:59.692 --> 06:02.028
...here.
...这里。

06:02.111 --> 06:06.532
Seeing the oncoming hazard,
I looked both ways and proceeded
safely toward my vehicle.
看到即将来临的危险，
我向两边看了看然后继续
安全地驶向我的车辆。

06:06.616 --> 06:10.328
It was then that I realized
I was being followed
at an unsafe distance.
那时我才意识到
我被跟踪了
在不安全的距离。

06:12.997 --> 06:16.209
So in order to create
more optimal driving conditions
所以为了创建
更优化的驾驶条件

06:16.292 --> 06:20.880
I was forced to then partake
in evasive action.
然后我被迫参加
在回避动作中。

06:22.924 --> 06:25.551
And by increasing speed slightly
并稍微提高速度

06:25.635 --> 06:29.388
I created a safety cushion
while inadvertently attracting
我创造了一个安全垫
在不经意间吸引

06:29.472 --> 06:33.101
the attention of said
law enforcement official.
所说的注意
执法官员。

06:33.184 --> 06:36.395
May I sit down now,
sweet cheeks?
我现在可以坐下吗
甜蜜的脸颊？

06:36.479 --> 06:37.647
Why, certainly.
为什么，当然。

06:37.730 --> 06:39.941
And perhaps now
也许现在

06:40.024 --> 06:43.069
SpongeBob would like
to come up and illustrate
his side of the story.
海绵宝宝想要
上来并说明
他的故事。

06:43.152 --> 06:45.363
His side?
他这边？

06:45.446 --> 06:49.909
Well, first, I started
over here, and then,
I went way over here.
嗯，首先，我开始了
在这里，然后，
我走到这里了。

06:49.992 --> 06:52.161
Doo-doo-doo-doo-doo, like that.
嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟，就这样。

06:52.245 --> 06:54.288
And then,
I went around like this,
and over here like that
然后，
我就这样绕了一圈
就在这里

06:54.372 --> 06:56.207
and across this way,
and then down here
穿过这条路，
然后到这里

06:56.290 --> 06:58.751
and over here like this,
and then...
在这里像这样
然后...

07:12.056 --> 07:17.186
And then, I came around
and stopped right here.
然后我就过来了
就停在这里。

07:17.270 --> 07:21.774
Class: SpongeBob and Squidward,
best boating buddies forever?
班级：海绵宝宝和章鱼哥，
永远最好的划船伙伴？

07:23.442 --> 07:25.528
Do you like it, Squidward?
你喜欢吗，章鱼哥？

07:25.611 --> 07:26.904
Shut it.
闭嘴。

07:30.992 --> 07:33.286
Ah, lunch time,
eh, boating buddy?
啊，午餐时间，
呃，划船的朋友吗？

07:36.414 --> 07:38.958
I'll have to eat over here,
just like back in grade school.
我一定要来这里吃饭
就像回到小学一样。

07:41.043 --> 07:42.545
Squidward, you got any
extra mustard in there?
章鱼哥，你有什么
那里有额外的芥末吗？

07:44.213 --> 07:46.632
Mm, bon appetit, Squiddy.
嗯，胃口好，鱿鱼。

07:51.637 --> 07:56.475
you've ruined my morning,
you've ruined my lunch,
and you're ruining my...
你毁了我的早晨
你毁了我的午餐
而你正在毁掉我的...

08:03.983 --> 08:05.860
Mrs. Puff: Ok, class.
普芙老师：好的，同学们。

08:05.943 --> 08:08.279
It's time for our behind
the wheel lesson.
是时候我们的背后了
轮子课。

08:08.362 --> 08:11.699
Squidward, you'll be riding
with SpongeBob.
章鱼哥，你会骑马
与海绵宝宝。

08:11.782 --> 08:14.243
Yeah, I never saw that coming.
是的，我从来没有预见到会发生这种事。

08:14.327 --> 08:17.997
Now, we're gonna take
this nice and slow.
现在，我们要采取
这又好又慢。

08:18.080 --> 08:21.334
SpongeBob, what do we do
when pulling away from the curb?
海绵宝宝，我们该怎么办
当驶离路边时？

08:21.417 --> 08:22.460
Step on the gas?
踩油门吗？

08:22.543 --> 08:23.711
Good.
好的。

08:23.794 --> 08:25.004
Nice and easy.
又好又容易。

08:25.087 --> 08:26.464
Now let's slow...
现在让我们慢慢...

08:27.924 --> 08:29.800
SpongeBob, look out!
海绵宝宝，小心！

08:34.096 --> 08:35.598
SpongeBob, give me the wheel.
海绵宝宝，把方向盘给我。

08:35.681 --> 08:36.766
I got it, I got it.
我明白了，我明白了。

08:38.100 --> 08:39.477
Just let go of it!
放开它吧！

08:41.562 --> 08:42.855
Hooligans!
流氓！

08:57.328 --> 08:59.705
Johnson, I've finally
figured out a way
约翰逊，我终于
想出了一个办法

08:59.789 --> 09:03.417
to shrink an ordinary mailman
down to the size
of a grain of sand.
缩小一个普通的邮递员
缩小到尺寸
一粒沙子。

09:03.501 --> 09:04.794
But how?
但如何呢？

09:04.877 --> 09:07.004
By using this shrink ray.
通过使用这种收缩射线。

09:10.716 --> 09:13.052
Mother of mercy!
慈母慈悲！

09:13.135 --> 09:14.553
Where'd they go?
他们去哪儿了？

09:14.637 --> 09:16.514
Scientist: There.
科学家：在那里。

09:16.597 --> 09:18.432
They're headed right for
that discarded potato chip.
他们正前往
那个被丢弃的薯片

09:20.851 --> 09:22.478
What's the matter?
怎么了？

09:22.562 --> 09:24.397
Potato chips
are his favorite snack.
薯片
是他最喜欢的零食。

09:24.480 --> 09:26.274
Johnson!
约翰逊！

09:26.357 --> 09:29.819
No!
不！

09:29.902 --> 09:32.572
No, no, no.
不，不，不。

09:44.166 --> 09:47.211
I never will understand
these city folk.
我永远不会明白
这些城里人。

09:47.295 --> 09:49.046
SpongeBob: Hey,
where'd Squidward go?
海绵宝宝：嘿，
章鱼哥去哪儿了？

09:55.011 --> 09:56.929
I was just leaving.
我正要离开。

09:59.056 --> 10:01.851
Mrs. Puff: Ok, class, it's time
to take our final exam.
Mrs. Puff：好的，同学们，时间到了
参加我们的期末考试。

10:01.934 --> 10:03.436
Please have your pencils ready.
请准备好你的铅笔。

10:03.519 --> 10:04.729
Psst.
嘘。

10:04.812 --> 10:06.772
Hey, boating buddy.
嘿，划船的朋友。

10:06.856 --> 10:08.983
If you need any help, I've taken
this test hundreds of times.
如果您需要任何帮助，我已经采取了
这样的测试已经有数百次了。

10:09.066 --> 10:10.985
How many times
do I have to tell you?
多少次
我必须告诉你吗？

10:11.068 --> 10:13.237
I am not your buddy.
我不是你的朋友。

10:13.321 --> 10:17.742
I don't need your help,
and I don't need you, ever!
我不需要你的帮助
我永远不需要你！

10:17.825 --> 10:20.369
Now, just kindly let me
take this stupid test
现在，请让我
参加这个愚蠢的测试

10:20.453 --> 10:24.415
so I can get out of here
and never have to see you again
for the rest of my life.
这样我就可以离开这里
永远不必再见到你
我的余生。

10:24.498 --> 10:26.709
Ok, Squidward, if that's
the way you want it.
好吧，章鱼哥，如果是的话
你想要的方式。

10:26.792 --> 10:28.711
Thank you.
谢谢。

10:37.928 --> 10:39.138
three more minutes, class.
还有三分钟，上课。

10:40.639 --> 10:42.099
SpongeBob.
海绵宝宝。

10:42.183 --> 10:43.726
SpongeBob, I need your help.
海绵宝宝，我需要你的帮助。

10:43.809 --> 10:45.061
Mrs. Puff: Two more minutes.
普夫夫人：还有两分钟。

10:45.144 --> 10:46.604
SpongeBob, please?
海绵宝宝，请吗？

10:46.687 --> 10:48.814
This is important.
这很重要。

10:48.898 --> 10:51.150
You said you didn't
need my help, Squidward,
and that you didn't need me.
你说你没有
需要我的帮助，章鱼哥，
并且你不需要我。

10:51.233 --> 10:52.651
No, no, I didn't.
不，不，我没有。

10:52.735 --> 10:54.570
I never said that.
我从来没有这么说过。

10:54.653 --> 10:57.656
I don't need your help,
and I don't need you.
我不需要你的帮助
我不需要你。

10:57.740 --> 11:00.076
Jerk.
混蛋。

11:00.159 --> 11:02.620
All right, I said it,
but that was before.
好吧，我说了，
但那是以前的事了。

11:02.703 --> 11:03.954
Before what?
在什么之前？

11:04.038 --> 11:06.165
Before... Before...
之前……之前……

11:06.248 --> 11:08.292
Mrs. Puff: One more
minute, class.
泡芙夫人：再来一张
分钟，上课。

11:08.376 --> 11:11.545
Before we were...
, boating buddies.
之前我们...
，划船的朋友。

11:12.671 --> 11:14.382
Yay!
耶！

11:14.465 --> 11:15.966
Mrs. Puff: Okay, class,
time is up.
泡芙老师：好的，同学们，
时间到了。

11:17.301 --> 11:19.387
Time can't be up.
时间不能到了。

11:19.470 --> 11:20.971
I didn't get a chance
to fill in a single answer.
我没有机会
填写一个答案。

11:21.055 --> 11:23.224
What am I supposed to do?
我该怎么办？

11:23.307 --> 11:25.142
You do the same thing
that everybody else does
who fails the test.
你做同样的事情
其他人都这样做
谁没有通过测试。

11:25.226 --> 11:26.894
You take it again next week.
你下周再服用一次。

11:26.977 --> 11:28.270
Next week?
下周？

11:28.354 --> 11:30.314
Don't worry, Squidward.
别担心，章鱼哥。

11:30.398 --> 11:32.525
I've never gotten one answer
right on this test
我一直没有得到一个答案
就在这次测试中

11:32.608 --> 11:35.194
but we'll meet again next week
at Mrs. Puff's boating school.
但我们下周会再见面
在普夫夫人的划船学校。

11:53.838 --> 11:55.047
SpongeBob: Order up!
海绵宝宝：快下单吧！

11:56.590 --> 11:58.551
How's it lookin' out there, boy?
孩子，外面看起来怎么样？

11:58.634 --> 12:00.719
Like two more
satisfied regulars, Mr. K.
还喜欢两个
满意的常客，K 先生。

12:00.803 --> 12:03.431
I ain't interested in the same
old regulars, SpongeBob.
我对同样的事情不感兴趣
老常客，海绵宝宝。

12:03.514 --> 12:06.809
So I took out an ad
in the Bikini Bottom Examiner
to bring in some new customers.
于是我就拿出了一个广告
在比基尼底部检查器中
引进一些新客户。

12:06.892 --> 12:08.394
'Twas a bargain too.
这也很划算。

12:08.477 --> 12:10.312
Only cost me a nickel.
只花了我五分钱。

12:10.396 --> 12:12.398
So tell me now, boy.
所以现在告诉我，孩子。

12:12.481 --> 12:15.818
How many new customers
we got out there so far?
有多少新客户
到目前为止我们已经到了那里了吗？

12:15.901 --> 12:17.236
Ooh, uh, let me see.
哦，呃，让我看看。

12:17.319 --> 12:19.029
There was... none.
没有……没有。

12:19.113 --> 12:20.406
What?
什么？

12:20.489 --> 12:22.366
What do you mean, none?
什么意思，没有？

12:22.450 --> 12:24.743
Don't these people
read the paper?
难道这些人
读报纸？

12:24.827 --> 12:27.246
Ooh.
哦。

12:27.329 --> 12:29.582
This thing hasn't been
touched in months.
这件事还没有
几个月来触动。

12:29.665 --> 12:33.335
While that paper is sellin'
like Krabby Patties.
当那张纸正在卖的时候
像蟹黄饼一样。

12:33.419 --> 12:35.588
Eh, pardon me, sir.
呃，请原谅我，先生。

12:35.671 --> 12:39.091
Could I interest you in a copy
of the Examiner this fine day?
我可以给你一份副本吗
考官在这个美好的日子？

12:40.676 --> 12:42.511
Nobody reads the Examiner, bud.
没有人读《审查员》，伙计。

12:42.595 --> 12:45.431
It's all full of
boring charts and facts.
都充满了
无聊的图表和事实。

12:45.514 --> 12:47.725
The Bottom Feeder
is where it's at.
底部进料器
就是它所在的地方。

12:47.808 --> 12:50.394
It's got, like,
interesting stories and stuff.
它有，比如，
有趣的故事和东西。

12:50.478 --> 12:52.188
Fish boy strikes again?
鱼男孩又来袭？

12:52.271 --> 12:54.023
Wait a minute.
等一下。

12:54.106 --> 12:55.941
Aren't these stories
a little less than truthful?
这些故事不就是
有点不诚实？

12:56.025 --> 12:58.027
I don't know,
but they're selling.
我不知道，
但他们正在卖。

12:58.110 --> 13:01.238
Yes, they certainly are.
是的，他们当然是。

13:01.322 --> 13:03.157
Please, allow me.
请允许我。

13:03.240 --> 13:04.492
Thank you.
谢谢。

13:04.575 --> 13:06.911
No, thank you.
不，谢谢。

13:06.994 --> 13:10.122
Now, let's see how much
they charge for advertising.
现在让我们看看有多少
他们收取广告费。

13:11.499 --> 13:13.792
25 cents per word?
每个字25美分？

13:13.876 --> 13:15.628
The newspaper business
sure is easy money.
报纸业务
当然是很容易赚钱。

13:19.048 --> 13:22.384
That gives me an idea.
这给了我一个想法。

13:24.887 --> 13:28.349
What a "fantabulastical" day,
Eh, Squiddy?
多么“梦幻”的一天啊
呃，鱿鱼？

13:28.432 --> 13:32.895
Yep, another wonderful,
humdrum day slinging burgers.
是的，另一个精彩，
乏味的一天吊着汉堡。

13:35.022 --> 13:37.191
Off of your duff, boy.
别再胡闹了，孩子。

13:37.274 --> 13:39.401
You think I spent all last night
assembling this printing press
你以为我昨晚度过了整个晚上
组装这台印刷机

13:39.485 --> 13:42.196
so you could
laze around all day?
所以你可以
整天闲逛？

13:42.279 --> 13:46.867
From now on,
you'll be twice as busy, and
I expect you to wear two hats
从现在开始，
你会加倍忙碌，并且
我希望你戴两顶帽子

13:46.951 --> 13:49.828
'cause along with
your usual fry-cookin' duties
因为随着
你平常的煎炸工作

13:49.912 --> 13:53.707
you're my lead reporter
for the new Krabby Kronicle.
你是我的首席记者
新款 Krabby Kronicle。

13:53.791 --> 13:56.335
Oh, my very own press badge!
哦，我自己的记者徽章！

13:56.418 --> 13:57.836
That's right, boy.
没错，孩子。

13:57.920 --> 14:00.548
And here's your very own camera.
这是您自己的相机。

14:00.631 --> 14:03.842
See, you'll need it to document
all them juicy stories
you're gonna write.
看，你需要它来记录
所有这些有趣的故事
你会写。

14:03.926 --> 14:06.053
Well, what are you
waitin' for, boy?
好吧，你是什么？
还在等吗，小伙子？

14:06.136 --> 14:08.681
The public thirsts for
a juicy story, Eh?
公众渴望
一个有趣的故事，嗯？

14:08.764 --> 14:11.433
Hm, but what kind of story
is juicy enough to quench
their dry news gullets?
嗯，但是什么样的故事
多汁足以解渴
他们的枯燥新闻咽喉？

14:11.517 --> 14:13.102
I don't even know where
to begin to look.
我什至不知道在哪里
开始寻找。

14:20.651 --> 14:22.528
hm, no news to report here.
嗯，这里没有消息可报道。

14:22.611 --> 14:24.863
Stop the presses, it's Patrick!
停止媒体报道，是帕特里克！

14:24.947 --> 14:27.992
And he appears to be
waiting for the bus.
而他似乎是
等公共汽车。

14:28.075 --> 14:31.829
This is the kind
of breaking story my readers
are waiting for.
就是这样的
我的读者的突发新闻
正在等待。

14:31.912 --> 14:33.706
Patrick Star?
帕特里克·斯塔？

14:33.789 --> 14:35.833
I'm Scoup SquarePants
from the Krabby Kronicle.
我是勺子方裤
来自克拉比纪事报。

14:35.916 --> 14:37.793
Everyone's wondering,
what bus are you taking today?
大家都在好奇，
你今天乘什么公共汽车？

14:37.876 --> 14:40.254
Oh, I'm not taking
a bus, SpongeBob.
哦，我不带
公共汽车，海绵宝宝。

14:40.337 --> 14:46.719
I am watching this pole,
so the next time it moves,
I will see it.
我看着这根柱子，
所以下次它移动的时候
我会看到的。

14:46.802 --> 14:49.930
Whoa, this story is juicy.
哇，这个故事很有趣。

15:01.358 --> 15:04.737
What a "money-tastical" day,
Eh, Mr. Squidward?
真是一个“金钱狂”的日子啊
呃，章鱼哥先生？

15:04.820 --> 15:07.072
Yeah, I'm just raking it in.
是的，我只是把它收起来。

15:07.156 --> 15:10.701
I'm excited about all
the newspaper sales too.
我对一切都很兴奋
报纸销售也如此。

15:10.784 --> 15:12.870
We haven't sold
any papers today.
我们还没卖
今天有什么论文。

15:12.953 --> 15:15.414
What do you mean,
we haven't sold any newspapers?
你是什么意思，
我们还没有卖过报纸吗？

15:15.497 --> 15:19.293
Certainly, this gentleman
would like a copy
of the Krabby Kronicle.
当然，这位先生
想要一份副本
克拉比纪事报。

15:19.376 --> 15:20.794
Looks boring.
看起来很无聊。

15:20.878 --> 15:22.254
Can I just have a Krabby Patty?
我可以只吃蟹黄饼吗？

15:22.338 --> 15:24.256
Too boring?
太无聊了？

15:24.340 --> 15:25.758
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

15:25.841 --> 15:27.343
What's the meaning of this?
这有什么意义呢？

15:27.426 --> 15:28.761
Meaning of what, Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板，这是什么意思？

15:28.844 --> 15:30.929
Local resident watches pole?
当地居民看杆？

15:31.013 --> 15:33.515
No one's gonna pay
to read this malarkey.
没有人会付钱
读这个胡言乱语。

15:33.599 --> 15:37.186
When you write these stories,
you got to use
a little imagination, boy.
当你写下这些故事时，
你必须使用
有点想象力，孩子。

15:37.269 --> 15:39.563
Imagination.
想像力。

15:39.647 --> 15:41.482
Yeah.
是的。

15:41.565 --> 15:43.859
Maybe instead of
"man watches pole"
也许代替
“男人看杆子”

15:43.942 --> 15:48.280
you could say something
like, oh, "man marries pole."
你可以说些什么
就像，哦，“男人嫁给了杆子。”

15:48.364 --> 15:52.326
Then you could alter the photo
to fit the headline, and see?
然后你可以改变照片
适合标题，看到了吗？

15:52.409 --> 15:54.453
Now, that's a juicy story.
现在，这是一个有趣的故事。

15:54.536 --> 15:55.954
Mr. Krabs, isn't that lying?
蟹老板，这不是撒谎吗？

15:56.038 --> 15:57.665
Don't think of it as lying, boy.
别以为这是撒谎，孩子。

15:57.748 --> 16:00.459
Think of it as a practical joke.
将其视为一个恶作剧。

16:00.542 --> 16:03.170
You know, something everybody
can have a good laugh about.
你知道，每个人都有一件事
可以好好笑一下。

16:03.253 --> 16:05.798
The public expects a little
embellishment here and there
公众有点期待
到处点缀

16:05.881 --> 16:10.886
so I want you to go out there
and get me a lead story
that'll sell.
所以我想让你出去
给我一个主要故事
那会卖的。

16:19.937 --> 16:21.980
Mrs. Puff is gonna laugh
her hat off when she reads this.
泡芙太太要笑了
当她读到这篇文章时，她脱下了帽子。

16:22.064 --> 16:24.233
Mr. Krabs: Boating teacher
in high speed chase!
Mr. Krabs：划船老师
高速追逐中！

16:24.316 --> 16:26.276
I think you've finally
done it, boy!
我想你终于
做到了，孩子！

16:26.360 --> 16:28.696
You've given me
a story that'll sell!
你给了我
一个会畅销的故事！

16:28.779 --> 16:30.280
And sell it has.
并出售它。

16:32.908 --> 16:34.910
yeah, but that isn't
the story I wrote.
是的，但那不是
我写的故事。

16:34.993 --> 16:37.037
That's called
Editorial privilege, son.
这就是所谓的
编辑特权，儿子。

16:37.121 --> 16:39.665
It gives it that extra "oomph"
to move units.
它赋予它额外的“魅力”
移动单位。

16:39.748 --> 16:44.920
Besides, how could such
a little news story possibly
effect Mrs. Puff in any way?
再说了，怎么可能这样
可能是一个小新闻故事
对泡芙夫人有什么影响吗？

16:45.003 --> 16:50.259
I can't believe such
a little news story
could have ruined my business.
我不敢相信这样
一个小新闻故事
可能会毁掉我的生意。

16:52.928 --> 16:55.097
Let's see what there is to see.
让我们看看有什么可看的。

16:55.180 --> 16:56.682
Wait a minute.
等一下。

16:56.765 --> 16:58.475
Larry the lobster.
龙虾拉里。

16:58.559 --> 17:00.519
Hm.
嗯。

17:00.602 --> 17:02.896
I wonder what kind of dirt
he has under those muscles.
我想知道什么样的污垢
他有那些肌肉。

17:04.481 --> 17:05.691
Ah-ha.
啊哈。

17:05.774 --> 17:07.484
This looks shady.
这看起来很阴暗。

17:07.568 --> 17:09.361
Very shady.
很阴暗。

17:09.445 --> 17:10.612
Larry.
拉里.

17:10.696 --> 17:12.281
Hey, tough guy.
嘿，硬汉。

17:12.364 --> 17:13.407
Can I punch you in the gut?
我可以打你肚子吗？

17:13.490 --> 17:14.700
Sure.
当然。

17:14.783 --> 17:16.326
Everybody does.
每个人都这样做。

17:16.410 --> 17:17.536
It won't hurt me a bit.
它不会伤害我一点点。

17:19.038 --> 17:20.372
Told you it wouldn't hurt.
告诉过你这不会伤害。

17:20.456 --> 17:21.707
Thanks, big guy.
谢谢大佬。

17:21.790 --> 17:23.208
See you around.
再见。

17:23.292 --> 17:25.586
Very interesting.
非常有趣。

17:25.669 --> 17:27.546
Male voice: Out, out, out!
男声：出去，出去，出去！

17:27.629 --> 17:29.381
Hey, what's the big idea?
嘿，有什么大主意吗？

17:29.465 --> 17:31.383
This!
这！

17:31.467 --> 17:33.552
Larry: Larry the loser
gets beaten up by pipsqueak?
拉里：失败者拉里
被pipsqueak殴打？

17:33.635 --> 17:34.887
But... But... But...
但是……但是……但是……

17:34.970 --> 17:37.055
No buts.
没有但是。

17:37.139 --> 17:39.641
I can't have a wimp like you
destroying my gym's reputation.
我不能拥有像你这样的懦夫
毁了我健身房的声誉。

17:39.725 --> 17:41.393
You're banned forever.
你被永远禁止了。

17:41.477 --> 17:42.644
Hello, Larry.
你好，拉里。

17:42.728 --> 17:44.688
Not now, SpongeBob.
现在不行，海绵宝宝。

17:44.772 --> 17:46.398
Let me take in the fact
that my life is ruined.
让我接受事实
我的生活被毁了。

17:46.482 --> 17:47.858
Ruined?
毁了？

17:47.941 --> 17:49.693
What're you talking about?
你在说什么？

17:49.777 --> 17:51.320
These lies someone
wrote about me.
这些谎言是某人
写了关于我的事。

17:52.905 --> 17:54.406
Mr. Krabs: Thanks for
your business.
蟹老板：谢谢
你的事。

17:54.490 --> 17:56.200
And here's your paper.
这是你的论文。

17:56.283 --> 17:57.659
Mr. Krabs, can I have
a word with you?
蟹老板，我可以吃吗
跟你说句话吗？

17:57.743 --> 17:59.912
Make it quick, boy.
快点吧，孩子。

17:59.995 --> 18:02.164
These papers are selling faster
than we can print 'em.
这些报纸卖得更快
我们可以打印它们。

18:02.247 --> 18:04.416
That's exactly what I wanted
to talk to you about, sir.
这正是我想要的
先生，要和你谈谈。

18:04.500 --> 18:06.376
I don't think these stories
are doing anyone any good.
我不认为这些故事
对任何人都有好处。

18:06.460 --> 18:07.878
Well, they're certainly
doing me some good.
嗯，他们当然是
对我有好处。

18:07.961 --> 18:09.421
Can you believe it?
你能相信吗？

18:09.505 --> 18:11.757
Look at all this loot!
看看这些战利品！

18:11.840 --> 18:17.429
Yeah, but isn't there a way
we could write juicy stories
without hurting people?
是啊，但是没有办法吗
我们可以写出有趣的故事
不伤害人？

18:19.264 --> 18:20.808
you just don't get it,
do you, boy?
你只是不明白，
你呢，男孩？

18:20.891 --> 18:23.143
We're not hurting anyone.
我们没有伤害任何人。

18:23.227 --> 18:25.687
We're just making their lives
interesting for everybody else.
我们只是在创造他们的生活
对其他人来说都很有趣。

18:25.771 --> 18:28.899
Now, get out there
and fetch another story.
现在，出去吧
并获取另一个故事。

18:30.526 --> 18:32.277
Oh, Karen.
哦，凯伦。

18:32.361 --> 18:34.488
I think this is it.
我想就是这样了。

18:34.571 --> 18:39.076
The chum stick that's finally
gonna drive Krabs
out of business.
最后的密棒
会开螃蟹
破产了。

18:40.536 --> 18:41.870
Male voice: I think not.
男声：我想不是。

18:41.954 --> 18:43.956
I'm Health Inspector Yellowtail.
我是卫生督察黄尾鱼。

18:44.039 --> 18:45.499
I'm officially closing
down your restaurant.
我要正式关门了
下你的餐厅。

18:45.582 --> 18:46.834
Why?
为什么？

18:46.917 --> 18:48.293
I haven't done anything.
我什么也没做。

18:49.795 --> 18:51.797
That's not what this says.
这不是这个意思。

18:51.880 --> 18:54.216
Plankton: Plankton's chum
made of your chums?
浮游生物：浮游生物的密友
由你的好友组成？

18:54.299 --> 18:56.593
The chum bucket
serves your friends
in more ways than one?
密友桶
为你的朋友服务
以多种方式？

18:56.677 --> 18:58.470
What?
什么？

18:58.554 --> 19:00.305
Who's to blame for this?
这该怪谁呢？

19:00.389 --> 19:01.807
Who?
WHO？
WHO？
WHO？
WHO？
世界卫生组织？
世界卫生组织？
世界卫生组织？

19:06.436 --> 19:09.231
You're reaching new levels
of imagination, boy-o.
你正在达到新的水平
想象力，男孩-o。

19:09.314 --> 19:10.774
Yeah, I know.
是的，我知道。

19:10.858 --> 19:12.317
What's wrong, boy?
怎么了，男孩？

19:12.401 --> 19:13.610
You sick or something?
你生病了还是怎么的？

19:13.694 --> 19:14.945
Yes, Mr. Krabs.
是的，蟹老板。

19:15.028 --> 19:16.488
You could say that.
你可以这么说。

19:16.572 --> 19:17.739
Don't be silly, boy.
别傻了，孩子。

19:17.823 --> 19:19.408
We're a success!
我们成功了！

19:19.491 --> 19:20.617
Mr. Krabs, we're hurting people.
蟹老板，我们正在伤害人们。

19:20.701 --> 19:22.578
Oh, baloney.
哦，胡说八道。

19:22.661 --> 19:24.663
And you better start feelin'
right, 'cause if you don't
你最好开始感觉
是的，因为如果你不这样做

19:24.746 --> 19:25.998
you can just kiss
your spatula goodbye.
你可以亲吻
你的抹刀再见。

19:26.081 --> 19:27.624
Mr. Krabs, you wouldn't!
蟹老板，你不会的！

19:27.708 --> 19:29.376
Oh, darn tootin', I would.
哦，该死的，我会的。

19:29.459 --> 19:30.836
Now get out there
and bring me a juicy one.
现在出去吧
给我带来一份多汁的。

19:30.919 --> 19:32.963
Aye-aye, Captain.
是的，船长。

19:37.926 --> 19:39.428
Sorry, "fellers".
对不起，“家伙们”。

19:39.511 --> 19:40.762
This is a private tree dome.
这是一个私人树顶。

19:40.846 --> 19:42.347
I had no idea it talked.
我不知道它会说话。

19:42.431 --> 19:44.057
Don't worry.
不用担心。

19:44.141 --> 19:46.435
We're from the Neptunian
Science Committee
我们来自海王星
科学委员会

19:46.518 --> 19:50.063
and we've come to confiscate
all your science awards.
我们是来没收的
你所有的科学奖项。

19:50.147 --> 19:51.648
Haven't you read
today's headlines?
你没读过吗
今天的头条新闻？

19:51.732 --> 19:53.650
It can't even read.
它甚至无法读取。

19:53.734 --> 19:54.943
Why are you...
你为什么...

19:55.027 --> 19:56.528
Oh, give me that!
哦，给我那个！

19:56.612 --> 19:58.572
Sandy Cheeks or Sandy Chump?
桑迪脸颊还是桑迪笨蛋？

19:58.655 --> 20:01.617
Bushy-tailed brainiac really
a slow-witted squirrel?
浓尾智者真的
一只迟钝的松鼠？

20:01.700 --> 20:03.619
By SpongeBob SquarePants?
海绵宝宝？

20:03.702 --> 20:06.371
That yellow sidewinder thinks
he can do that to me?
那黄响尾蛇认为
他可以这样对我吗？

20:06.455 --> 20:07.706
Oh, boy.
哦，男孩。

20:07.789 --> 20:09.541
We'd better scram.
我们最好赶紧滚吧。

20:09.625 --> 20:10.918
The dumb ones are always
the most violent.
笨蛋总是
最暴力的。

20:17.132 --> 20:18.884
You've really outdone
yourself this time.
你真的已经不甘示弱了
这次你自己。

20:23.013 --> 20:25.891
Mr. Krabs, I can't write
these stories anymore.
蟹老板，我不会写
这些故事不再了。

20:25.974 --> 20:27.935
Come on,
that's a bunch of hooey.
来吧，
那是一堆胡言乱语。

20:28.018 --> 20:30.854
I've seen people's lives
ruined with my own eyes.
我见过人们的生活
被我亲眼所毁。

20:30.938 --> 20:33.065
People want wild, juicy stories.
人们想要狂野、有趣的故事。

20:33.148 --> 20:35.567
That's what sells.
这就是卖的东西。

20:35.651 --> 20:38.820
Now, I want your little,
yellow noggin to come up
with the wildest story ever.
现在，我想要你的小，
黄头出现
有史以来最疯狂的故事。

20:38.904 --> 20:41.240
One that'll top all the others.
一款将超越所有其他产品的产品。

20:41.323 --> 20:42.824
Well, gee, Mr. Krabs,
I've written about
everyone in town.
好吧，哎呀，蟹老板先生，
我写过关于
镇上的每个人。

20:42.908 --> 20:44.201
Any ideas, sir?
有什么想法吗，先生？

20:44.284 --> 20:45.535
Surprise me.
让我惊讶。

20:45.619 --> 20:48.413
Give me a shocker.
给我一个震撼。

20:48.497 --> 20:50.207
Good night, boy.
晚安，孩子。

20:50.290 --> 20:52.250
I'll check on you
tomorrow morning.
我会检查你的情况
明天早上。

20:52.334 --> 20:54.962
And remember,
the wildest story ever.
请记住，
有史以来最疯狂的故事。

20:55.045 --> 20:58.340
Ah, the wildest story ever, huh?
啊，有史以来最疯狂的故事，是吧？

21:01.551 --> 21:04.179
How's it goin', lad?
怎么样，小伙子？

21:06.181 --> 21:08.558
Ah, it's a surprise.
啊，真是意外啊。

21:08.642 --> 21:09.977
Mr. Krabs: Excellent.
蟹老板：太棒了。

21:10.060 --> 21:11.853
We're gonna sell out in no time.
我们很快就会卖完。

21:11.937 --> 21:13.563
We'll have to do
another printing.
我们必须做
另一种印刷。

21:13.647 --> 21:15.315
huh?
嗯？

21:15.399 --> 21:16.692
Taskmaster!
监工！

21:16.775 --> 21:18.276
What's going on?
这是怎么回事？

21:18.360 --> 21:20.112
You should know!
你应该知道！

21:20.195 --> 21:21.613
Krabs overworks employees?
蟹老板让员工过度劳累？

21:21.697 --> 21:23.532
Reaps reward?
收获回报？

21:23.615 --> 21:26.076
Krabby Kronicle mastermind
behind bogus stories
Krabby Kronicle 策划者
虚假故事背后

21:26.159 --> 21:29.454
pays his tired,
underage reporter pennies
while he rakes in the dough?
付出他的疲惫，
未成年记者便士
当他耙面团的时候？

21:29.538 --> 21:32.666
How could you do that
to such an innocent child?
你怎么能这么做
对这样一个无辜的孩子？

21:32.749 --> 21:35.335
It's sick and inhumane.
这是病态且不人道的。

21:35.419 --> 21:38.797
Not to mention the fact
that he's written lies about us.
更不用说事实
他写了关于我们的谎言。

21:38.880 --> 21:41.842
I lost my restaurant
because of you.
我失去了我的餐厅
因为你。

21:41.925 --> 21:43.844
And I thought  I  was evil.
我以为我是邪恶的。

21:43.927 --> 21:46.638
All the kids in town want
to beat me up for lunch money.
镇上所有的孩子都想要
为了午饭钱而打我。

21:48.765 --> 21:52.436
And I've had to go back
to watching daytime television.
我不得不回去
看白天的电视。

21:52.519 --> 21:53.895
That's it!
就是这样！

21:53.979 --> 21:55.564
We're taking our money back!
我们要拿回我们的钱！

22:01.069 --> 22:02.988
Mr. Krabs, are you ok?
蟹老板，你还好吗？

22:03.071 --> 22:06.033
How can I be ok
when me money's gone?
我怎样才能好
当我的钱没了？

22:07.576 --> 22:08.994
All gone.
全部消失了。

22:13.540 --> 22:18.503
it just goes to show,
trying to make an easy buck
doesn't pay.
它只是表明，
试图轻松赚钱
不付钱。

22:20.088 --> 22:22.007
Or does it?
或者确实如此？

22:30.057 --> 22:31.725
Get me some scissors, boy-o.
给我一些剪刀，男孩。

22:31.808 --> 22:33.852
It's time to use  my  imagination.
是时候发挥我的想象力了。

22:33.935 --> 22:35.854
Patrick: Hey, guys?
帕特里克：嘿，伙计们？

22:35.937 --> 22:39.483
Can you fix me and the wife up
a couple of Krabby Patties?
你能帮我和妻子安顿一下吗
几个蟹黄饼？

你能帮我和妻子安顿一下吗
几个蟹黄饼？